  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been looking at all these cannies requesting more options to tweak in the client. \n\nThe majority of these options are only going to be used by a small subset of users, predominantly developers of avatars/worlds, etc. \n\nWhat might be useful is to provide a simplified interface for new users or people who don't do a lot of dev work, then have a separate menu with all the fine tweaks that people are requesting. \n\nThat way new users have a nice, streamlined interface to get used to the game with, then more advanced users can have a cluttered menu full of all the options that are being requested. \n\nThis makes it where you have to support/modify multiple menus, but it might be worth looking into.  :)",
